config BR2_PACKAGE_CP_MUX_PROBE
	bool "cp-mux-probe"
	help
	  Standalone usbmux VERSION probe for the iPhone, with no FastCarPlay
	  involved. Claims the mux interface (ff/fe, EP 0x04 OUT / 0x85 IN) in
	  USB config 6, sends a usbmux VERSION packet and reports whether the
	  phone replies.

	  Exists to separate "the MUSB host cannot service the mux bulk-IN
	  endpoint while usb0 is up" from "the app is asking wrongly" -- every
	  measurement so far has been taken through the app and cannot tell
	  those apart. See docs/musb-mux-starvation.md.

	  Speaks usbfs directly, so it depends on nothing but libc.
